{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38606","headline":"府试雨夜帝里闻猿声 · 吴融","name":"府试雨夜帝里闻猿声","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雨滴秦中夜，猿闻峡外声。\n已吟何逊恨，还赋屈平情。\n暗逐哀鸿泪，遥含禁漏清。\n直疑游万里，不觉在重城。\n霎霎侵灯乱，啾啾入梦惊。\n明朝临晓镜，别有鬓丝生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38606.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38606","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}